{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42771","headline":"重阳感怀 一 · 刘兼","name":"重阳感怀 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳不忍上高楼，寒菊年年照暮秋。\n万叠故山云总隔，两行乡泪血和流。\n黄茅莽莽连边郡，红叶纷纷落钓舟。\n归计未成年渐老，茱萸羞戴雪霜头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}